  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial stable release! Complete Entity Framework Core 9.0 persistence layer for SourceFlow.Net including CommandStore, EntityStore, and ViewModelStore implementations. Features configurable connection strings per store type, SQL Server database provider, Polly resilience policies, OpenTelemetry instrumentation, and support for .NET 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0. Production-ready with comprehensive test coverage.",
